      "body": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "text": "Aik biologist ne aik hi species ke 9 paudon ki unchai naapi: 56, 65, 74, 75, 76, 77, 80, 81 aur 91 cm."
          },
          {
            "type": "list",
            "ordered": false,
            "items": [
              "Qadam 1: mean nikalein: (56 + 65 + 74 + 75 + 76 + 77 + 80 + 81 + 91)/9 = 675/9 = 75 cm.",
              "Qadam 2: har qeemat se mean manfi (subtract) karein; is se har qeemat ka deviation (farq) milta hai.",
              "Qadam 3: har deviation ka murabba (square) lein; is se minus nishan khatam ho jate hain aur bare farq zyada numayan ho jate hain.",
              "Qadam 4: in murabbon ki average lein; isi ko variance kehte hain.",
              "Qadam 5: qadam 4 ke jawab ka square root (jazr) lein; yahi standard deviation hai."
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "table",
            "caption": "Paudon ki unchai ki standard deviation ka hisaab (kitab ka table)",
            "header": [
              "Unchai (cm) xᵢ",
              "Mean µ",
              "Har qeemat se mean manfi (xᵢ - µ)",
              "Deviation ka murabba (xᵢ - µ)²",
              "Murabbon ka jama ∑(xᵢ - µ)²",
              "Variance (murabbon ki average) ∑(xᵢ - µ)²/N",
              "Standard deviation σ = √(∑(xᵢ - µ)²/N)"
            ],
            "rows": [
              [
                "56",
                "75",
                "56 – 75 = -19",
                "361",
                "784",
                "87.11",
                "9.33"
              ],
              [
                "65",
                "",
                "65 – 75 = -10",
                "100",
                "",
                "",
                ""
              ],
              [
                "74",
                "",
                "74 – 75 = -1",
                "1",
                "",
                "",
                ""
              ],
              [
                "75",
                "",
                "75 – 75 = 0",
                "0",
                "",
                "",
                ""
              ],
              [
                "76",
                "",
                "76 – 75 = 1",
                "1",
                "",
                "",
                ""
              ],
              [
                "77",
                "",
                "77 – 75 = 2",
                "4",
                "",
